{"date":"2025-06-11","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_e845cbc68770aa85e0a7610a8d207344","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1749634200,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-06-08","chunk":0,"id":"m_163393b8aa1694582f96d780213197d8"}}},{"id":"m_3f3f4d88e7b1eb7377aecb7d5dc1b52e","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1749634237,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e402927c68331cd97455ca7c75ff458d","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1749634274,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_1b6a6c8b8f1d51cafaec2a769714f4ee","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1749634311,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_965b368b3d9e20880f6a127e56f878fb","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1749634348,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_f34eed776f644c51904d8c12191a6a20","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1749634385,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_d03c252117613c674f62168385c99b91","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1749634422,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_0a5137860294088e72d4c4f042710161","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1749634459,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_c3e02e375ba5c8af9832b179fab3049f","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1749634496,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_67ccebf0b98b0c08d1f2851d52cf687b","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1749634533,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_79e1965b96be53e9c83cdfeae5059cc2","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1749634570,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_dbbd290f3cf47eff6a2deaa13aca2863","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1749634607,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_08eea671407fce3fced3ad124d1da339","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1749634644,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_98cdb7257e3455d3d2304725573d6576","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1749634681,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_86035d93be325a2f0f9f4af83d64c55c","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1749634718,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4f50203f30e9dbdb9672d921af9f1efa","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1749634755,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_1dab9d738f2a607bc46f012ba7592b73","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1749634792,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7bfb061789a9f8c026f97dc90a2127c4","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1749634829,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ce0c0a2a42a2b954854042c16ff797f2","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1749634866,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_7b4a365f6c8255b0de415d0280605973","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1749634903,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b923f5d5383edd625ac77394751cd358","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1749634940,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_76bfe6a8114c76f025933ffc83e50c36","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1749634977,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_32a336c17e5ce3c91939c22b9a7e7b01","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1749635014,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_85508c0df2fd7e75b2ec6b8d5db16e25","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1749635051,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
